        "description": "Retrieve information about a tenant. The attributes object will contain flags indicating whether or not certain features are enabled on the tenant. Kibo employees can reference <a href=\"/pages/tenant-attributes\">this internal-only documentation</a> for a list of all attributes. </ul>",
